OL,3,GNEWSAControversial #180m busway given
OL,4,Ago ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial new #180m busway
OL,7,Fplanned to run through an historic
OL,8,Forchard has been given the green light
OL,9,Fby the government.
OL,11,FThe busway project known as C2C,
OL,12,Flinking 8.6 miles (13.8km) between
OL,13,FCambridge and Cambourne, is hoped to
OL,14,Fprovide 10,000 daily passenger trips.
OL,16,FThere were more than 300 objections to
OL,17,Fthe move, with the proposed route
OL,18,Frunning through a century-old orchard
OL,19,Fin Coton which contains about 1,000
OL,20,Ftrees, growing 26 varieties of apples
OL,21,Fas well as pears and plums.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
